From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AmperageOverspend <no@email.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 21:03:57 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Shell: an Engine setting for a game with a host of its own

A game the shared app runs on its own host (DmHost<title ID>.framework) gets
a setting in its launcher.json: Engine, this game's engine (own, the default)
or the shared app's engine (shared), for comparing the two. ShellMain.m keeps
the built-in host when DM_SHELL_HOST=shared.

- settings.tsv: the DM_SHELL_HOST row, shown under the new condition own-host
  (the build sets DM_HOST_FRAMEWORK: build_ipa.sh, build_host.sh).
- docs/settings.md: the setting and its variable.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

Upstream-Status: pending
Reason: lets the player run a game with a host of its own on the shared app's host instead, to compare the two
Issue: LNPANDY/NX2Apple#626
---
 dm/games/settings.py                     |  1 +
 dm/games/settings.tsv                    |  4 +++-
 dm/ios/Shell/ShellMain.m                 |  7 +++++++
 dm/ios/tests/test_shell_build.py         |  8 ++++++++
 dm/tools/tests/test_launcher_settings.py | 10 ++++++++--
 docs/settings.md                         |  7 ++++++-
 6 files changed, 33 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/dm/games/settings.py b/dm/games/settings.py
index d16b9cb..1a9b373 100644
--- a/dm/games/settings.py
+++ b/dm/games/settings.py
@@ -74,6 +74,7 @@ def build(gid, patched, control):
         if cond.startswith('fixups:'): return cond[7:] in keys
         if cond.startswith('gfxapi:'): return os.environ.get('GFXAPI', '') == cond[7:]
         if cond.startswith('platform:'): return platform == cond[9:]
+        if cond == 'own-host': return bool(os.environ.get('DM_HOST_FRAMEWORK'))   # the shared app's game with a host of its own (build_host.sh)
         m = re.fullmatch(r'(DM_GAME_\w+)(!=|==)(.*)', cond)
         if m: return (macro(m[1], n) == m[3]) == (m[2] == '==')
         sys.exit(f'settings.tsv:{n}: unknown condition {cond}')
