 DM_SHOW_FPS	toggle	-	build:DM_SHOW_FPS	platform:ios	Game	Frame-rate counter
+DM_SHELL_HOST	choice	own=This game's engine,shared=The shared app's engine	own	own-host	Game	Engine	The shared app's engine does not have this game's engine changes: the game may not start with it.
