+### Engine
+
+Only in the shared iPhone app, for a game built with an engine of its own (a Mac launcher game engine file that changes the engine). **This game's engine**, the default, runs the game on the engine it was built with. **The shared app's engine** runs it on the engine every other game of the app uses, which does not have this game's changes: the game may not start. It is there to compare the two.
+
